  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a1095111a1843a4ed718575",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶，好烦躁啊。\r\n……快点完事吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "002417d3944a27f2b320c1cde00c468feb456fe4e53ffea940c266bd8357121a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90b5ecb56827152a515d2644",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……别用这种烦人的眼神看我。\r\n担心什么的，太多管闲事了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca32b6fa7c5250122f5c4c4fafa5c46fff5f6c05fd5a2735ae515ff5b7b9cc95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3ae136f394b4e26885e17c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该死，身子好沉重……\r\n到底是什么原因？\r\n身体方面应该没出什么问题吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee5898cc47ada6e1b76cb31f6698829f92beeb746f569e96a44f11d97dd967d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73bb8017c9b9816c66156e0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……能够有逻辑地解释清楚排满赛程的理由，\r\n你肯定已经准备好了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "529edf12445a546b9f37ba6f18aa9cacbef93345017ee0cfa529eff136988c0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84477a9a9aacfce241f26a94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊？你那话认真的？\r\n那就试着逻辑地说明一下\r\n为什么要频繁参赛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0033317e6052ce10282227afe10444ef70689f555e3586a1665db2024e5c2a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:117da7fb931cd0a64c03c11f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "库库。真没想到能顺利的把状态\r\n调整到这种程度啊！\r\n比赛结果会和我所看到的一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ed8afe5b91ff38822f171c9cd66fc4f9794ad26aac8c3d830035e6c5c7a4d85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8114635b60d856e77fc9b9d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，心情真不错。\r\n……为什么？\r\n因为啊，我已经看到了计算出的比赛结果了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbfe18ea5557840c5940d5c063b6179e73958a6bb477a7bc1a5831f61c9f2daf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a281b72f13c0533fb356b6f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态调整的结果也和计算的一样……\r\n这样的话，就能让全场观众大吃一惊了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "482c9081fc9fd3ebab9d9b97c41ac897da98c8cc2e3078a8987362ba24fa3692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83f42c88cdf9c6be5ddae261",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要稍微留意一下其他家伙，\r\n数据就不会产生偏差。\r\n也就是说，比赛结果也会和预计的一样呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5070cfa1395a65fbfc676ec711317c6c34cee9db8dd366c592c8f743bcb588ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27a80ae6c5a6083f1dec0df1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态调整的很理想啊。\r\n就让你见识一下，\r\n和推算结论相差无几的结果吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc513d744ef94b531537dd6cd8d8dc8f5674020c0ba26900d173f77e74da996f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c352ae0a9ce31c22ef37612",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所有人的数据都搞到手了。\r\n之后只要按照计算结果，\r\n就能够击败一切对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0954dde648c0edb4253b931b359f40c08e848d279153fc05fbcd7f016c5bbb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b64d523f7c12476a1349c2d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态还说得过去。\r\n……之后就是按照推算出的节奏跑起来就行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6107ff5e7e261e41ed9f0f5426a805ccd32af8d7bbf4252e975f07c7aae21ccf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43b123e5a43f64b8d728af3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态还不错。\r\n这样就能跑出和预期相符的成绩了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "093cbdfb507506c0e74ea3358c5bcd7c9fd87b02941ece3ebcd860bb8708a13b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf95de0839b859178fcaa8f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不好不坏。\r\n……嘛，这样的话影响最终结果\r\n的变数也就不大了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2829477869a30747eb01ddd033a6d509fc148dad7dbb0f06bcccdd528e488196",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca96c3501f1a5746f131b46d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……现在就别说些多余的话了吧？\r\n本来就已经很不爽了，别再来烦我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94a4e477c6efdf0dacbd11f4aa16e4a32941804fdeadfe00a99471338f2b5207",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d373d146e524d2fce30f79bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算状态稍差也不会影响到最终结果。\r\n这种程度的早就验证过了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55b94eaaaff14354762688a6aa930e89175ade14d58b81b3201e048d1889d459",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bc9426270d2854283c26cb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～该死，净是些刺耳的欢呼声。\r\n……赶紧完事吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87f4eecc876f8546bc931af37734110cfb7709fee3707d983ea5c9d5cf68587c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:547d60e0f8476566473f4725",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……状态差的不行啊。\r\n话是这么说，不过这种情况我也早就推算过了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10fac1b201c5fb7e4339e279d66532ee57ecf24a5e3baf03a383f59f4018c102",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a63662054076a423358f6e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好闷……赛场上的噪音\r\n比平时还要吵的多啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "68087bee90f7171ebd63ec4a7a2f53e421591b4985e46e39e7df2d9a9163db37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:974d1493c2b1604824a39817",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态会这么差还真是少见啊……\r\n……喂，今天的数据可要好好收集啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7771c5061f4041c7d4ee25b94b3da259588bc0e3f4cdd43c7fce1b96b871fce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
