      "source_fingerprint": "3adf6a76f1642daf3d8b8c0a5684d52f398713b1a5a2f9ba3894f2de151ea359",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bde513447820061b524c1685",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "オラッ、計算通りなンだよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ef24c1f60358fa164dd566fe010c09aa21f7397ac5c0a4697c8bad5d5d5d542",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51b2b57675dab35d8a4b92d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "验证开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95b6b0dd50333df3ea04c3db51183dc3639c207794f708b2b0e25c24cf2b2f01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05b2b2fd50da0d0a01d3274b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "逻辑的战术，已经组织好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dd6bf672e2d0524a259a5a90fbc1d8b111ae42e83cd429f05f55c5867a9f5ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a44a8f0bfcad3b7edee0e0f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ドロワねェ…。\r\n面白い組み合わせのレースが\r\n増えンのはありがてェが…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83114d0029e143770ab23292411033c01bf59a1b91fa73507931842004a6a827",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9694bfb08c2e87e26d3001ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…前ン時より騒がしいな。\r\n企画が増えたからかァ？\r\nオレには…。…関係ねェけど。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ffba511b51b26d8fa8b883b80a843a8688175d02dabfe585cf53fc52b17087f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a5e4d465a2b6c4379725f74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タップのツレが持ち込ンだ\r\nミキサー…クソゴツかったな。\r\n…機材詳しいヤツだろうな、アレは",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ae7ce2a2fbcb0719c447c3ca96e930953ae20df170b5ae867919879fc4e15c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4acd1dba1e52dda51e9ec0b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アー…結局、首突っ込ンじまった。\r\nしかし、イイ機材揃えてたな…。\r\n腐らせねェように、使ってやるか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eab704e348b99480253334622db34d5fbaab7b99a16aad34f9b4b54e298ffc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd37138d2f428bb3cf26c64d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都被这噪音迷惑了吗……！\r\n就用我的“逻辑”来，打破这障碍——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "878c23c3c6cb37019fda071f023c0598c3a9686e0b26abc5f26965af52e07038",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3a8a472b2b4e429247a4008",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントミッションだとよ。\r\n裏ワザ教えてやろうかァ？\r\n…バァカ、嘘だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21e3e276299ba29ebc2b8025c8d2d98a720ee87f42eccf9c2d1f8e2861969c83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58d90dcfc9bbc65a09dc4e81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頂けるもんサクッと頂いて、\r\n次は――シメのラーメン？\r\nいらねェよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "acc21861553e770f22aa54b1a208dd56efacb8d45bd7152643ab44e59312adfb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:160fd6cc2fe4b9b8596c878b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッ、アポカリプスといくかァ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d035d5e613a8e3caf410a2e3de5f4db97409e528d56ad88e519bfa124488549",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f88298a2242f9aef67679010",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "踏み入ったからには……覚悟はできてンだろうなァ？\r\nハッ、悪夢を始めようぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7057e34a77835af1779b188b0171cae67f0186ccee49554dfbb365af7e654f2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c7db5b60d55d2f9486acdd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハァ…やっぱオレのセリフ\r\n多すぎンだろ。アー…クソ。\r\n…勝手に抜くか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d2dfa69ef1d2d957c459d1e7a03a3eb63ca4e63a63c9e9d54cd93aaaa0f93a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "400058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79e10ef578744184e8154d09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行こうぜ……",
      "source_fingerprint": "130cfbda7761e12140a9e7ed2452a9dd48d1261264b40f625fbef9b5893f435e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6742da0abf9fe459c52b6d96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よしッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb9ee5b9b253f3633d60a952a705d1b4f7735fdd9d390245615ca920b83cf0f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce3ee1baff1e14cc0afff09c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おお！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d4b2f7f63c553ce6ac99d702c4373da79a0dcdaf2106415e5c37f9a82e3025",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99a88d7628b87d9230ac1b3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おお！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d4b2f7f63c553ce6ac99d702c4373da79a0dcdaf2106415e5c37f9a82e3025",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8aa59c23842d77c992dba62a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "へッ……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e820ef4820a1da20f09946ca9271fd8ce2e45274f109ccd3971c2cb9b7f751c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0917cbe9123fcf29667b16f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "へッ……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e820ef4820a1da20f09946ca9271fd8ce2e45274f109ccd3971c2cb9b7f751c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "410005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2caf68c7585e5588fa36728a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はーァ……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ca70b0126125c7ebcef2611d8f1148a1cbec60faa3570cfaf561c0d52fe41b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "410006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a66335840abef4296abcd554",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はーァ……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ca70b0126125c7ebcef2611d8f1148a1cbec60faa3570cfaf561c0d52fe41b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "410007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5e1eacb428a62a5bf19838c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はーァ……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ca70b0126125c7ebcef2611d8f1148a1cbec60faa3570cfaf561c0d52fe41b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dd03a935b397eb1a868e22f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让我来炒热，会场的气氛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5d0642a6ca182cf09963bca365f37a6d4dede6f9dbf05e8eddb109abf2b01b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:423bcb5fad36dac487696533",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机会难得，可要好好看着啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac7c364429db9f684302984ed4b290429eff4f23945138be4e6527a6f46a615b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74fb87140049eb6319adb791",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有逻辑地行动吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a738bab2d49ee2fb841f079921414dd3c869143a63baf913cb7cce7a182d762",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7edca96a829f2065bb9bd0af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟在我屁股后面，结果也被警察盘问时的你的那幅表情。\r\n哎呀，真是杰作啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7ca95e99bb6595628d0eaa386aa544bc7e9fdb2993ac65b94bbebc3b354e915",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:101f2f94c3bf440af516651d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，算是蛮说得过去的设计？",
      "source_fingerprint": "07be2e4813e5bb46857a9bfd9fec223205d1e0ac391ce3a9a8a16ab3ee12fa29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18dcf1d48686849044e12fde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和这身衣服的风格唱反调的话才没效率吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f730b6aa0a59e2e8ce6b19b3bf36f508889140066e061396b697438a4a49bcf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70bcf97ac955f7dfb876b8a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是很吸睛的设计对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cde0570d28d4159a8c7cd2647826122add4ea05e15ebe002d8d38c497bb78fae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dae72a5eceb3703b16b255f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "合不合身？马马虎虎吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51c2fc405d90d8c3d6264bc83dd2937ea80a084b92b66e0088b1db9c52cb7ad5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5e03ac1b28a489abc1aee42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啥啊，Live的排练吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "edadd1f12e893e0d4acfa7043c469c59f098b3144a6cfab4ae50bf8fd8f9c3fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a00074d904677de9522df24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让你看到和推算相符的结果吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d081bbdcb8a3cd86cad3a26662275e6b02be17294f14dfe43826f9d3c32bfd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c08577431c1e2ae608eb6d54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "デザインは精査してる。モチベが下がると\r\nパフォーマンスに影響すっからな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08a5ae6da31c17a6bb9b57ef998be2d0d53e0e030928561e37218d38acd743e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c67560522a9353008310a861",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "暗い場所で光るトリックについて？\r\nハ、教えるかよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1bd1710e6553701c2f364b3147920a01ff1a34365eafd8df383a1015f08043d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff2789d63878864013d1989c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管穿着什么去比赛，\r\n推算的结果都不会改变的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c994871d7d9724ad761264176ab0e625e873bc06d9b2c7fa674c2a6a225a8273",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1036",
        "70018"
      ]
    }
  ]
